Flintcode is an independently maintained fork of the MIT-licensed Tau
harness, Copyright (c) 2026 Tau contributors. Tau composes the MIT-licensed
pi libraries by Earendil Works:

  https://pi.dev
  https://github.com/earendil-works/pi

Packages used include @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent, pi-agent-core, pi-ai,
pi-tui and pi-mcp. Flintcode is not affiliated with or endorsed by Earendil
Works, Tau's maintainers, Qoder AI, Alibaba, Nous Research, or any provider
named in its documentation.

Qoder CLI is not included or modified. Qoder CLI has no public source
repository; its npm distribution is a minified Apache-2.0 bundle. Qoder is
referenced only as the source of the terminal UX inspiration. The Qoder Agent
SDK was inspected as part of the architecture research; its custom-model path
is server-side and is not used by Flintcode.

The Nous Portal OAuth design is informed by:
- @magpie-community/opencode-nous-auth (MIT), github.com/magpie-community/plugins
- @ravshansbox/pi-nous (MIT), github.com/ravshansbox/pi-nous

The pi/tau Nous integration installs the latter package from npm; it is not
bundled in this repository. The public device flow and client identifier are
used; no credentials, tokens or other applications' session files are included.

